* Grading the perturbation character to order `m` leaves
  `‖φ‖ ≤ Σ_{k<m}(|θ|r)^k C_k‖φ(rθ/σ)‖^{n−2k} + (|θ|r)^m E|q|^m/m!`. The damped slots are
  harmless throughout `|θ| ≥ n^{a}` — that is exactly what wave 42's two new damped inputs
